astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b8q1sMqyyxMQ7kNvwFTBZmH&_nc_oc=Adk8vBa06ZYiZJgJBr4oQ23EqCcqkbu2eAcHgqohJKVCO4xYQqIwhDg25m3ynQ_MM38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftbjMzC5TrTcU9aBdrkuB60BVeFCxJYX5SJa6eD_VDKdw&oe=69A56CF3"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AVc6IYBALEUQ7kNvwFkbkYf&_nc_oc=AdkgwVsOhSI5TerV2-1hQ69NJq-lRuyn3VA_rbjkGEHkyPgjjuogWpvdgjOJc4c0bzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsx8spo9Ib3NMqRb15L3V6NFOrQL8Hs87TLNZ1Sw5NCCQ&oe=69A56D96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3yZ2-SS51ZsQ7kNvwF0pp5B&_nc_oc=AdmykzREhsLLUXWgy-op39MCJbi2CQUPBbK68rbH8QUbL737FntMUdXjp2bs2ONyU9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftyv9G86kwBlXMLt5epQug5Z2ovzYr1FRzDdHKqzP4fEA&oe=69A58C3D"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip